# Site nav pill menu (restorable)

The black pill menu at the top (`src/components/Header.jsx` + `Header.css`) was **temporarily removed** from `App.jsx` at the user's request. Keep those files intact.

When asked to bring the menu back:
- Re-render `<Header setCursorVariant={...} handleCursorChange={...} />` in `App.jsx`
- Style: fixed centered black pill, white text, items `work | play | about | resume`
- On the horizontal home page, work/play/about should call `scrollHomeTo(id)` from `src/utils/scrollHome.js` (not separate routes)
- `/play` and `/about` still redirect to `/#play` and `/#about`
